1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Welcome to our live MVP deployed on Vercel.
Here you can explore the feed,
create free posts, and view trending content.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:15,000
To interact, users connect their Solana wallet,
and in this prototype we simulate the wallet authorization flow.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:24,500
This creates a seamless experience while preserving the core social dynamics of the product.

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:33,500
To eliminate low-effort spam and encourage meaningful conversations,
posting a comment triggers a micro-fee.

5
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:43,500
In this prototype build, we simulate the fee split logic:
60% goes directly to the creator's wallet,
40% feeds the Creator Piñata pool.

6
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:53,500
The remainder supports platform maintenance
and the monthly Platform Piñata.

7
00:00:53,500 --> 00:01:03,500
Here on the creator profile,
you can see the Creator Piñata progress.

8
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:14,000
Once it reaches at least 50% of its goal,
the creator can trigger the Pop action.

9
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:25,000
This distributes accumulated rewards exclusively
to users who commented after the current Piñata was created.

10
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:35,000
This creates a continuous loop of community engagement
and stronger participation.

11
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:48,000
All core UI and UX flows,
plus the state management logic,
are fully operational in this Vercel deployment.

12
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:58,000
This sets up a strong foundation
for on-chain smart contract integration on Solana Devnet.
